{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116306","id":3286174755,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7D3wwj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116306","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116306.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116306.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116306","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116306/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116306/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116306/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/11e981e75363003008368147655d5f82631e692e","number":116306,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Animation: Fix timeline length control clipping","user":{"login":"zhuguanxin","id":64935188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTM1MTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64935188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin","html_url":"https://github.com/zhuguanxin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\nFixes clipping of the Animation Timeline right-side length controls under large editor fonts/scales.\r\n\r\n### Problem\r\nWhen editor font/scale is increased, the timeline length controls can be partially clipped, making them hard to read/edit.\r\nThe issue is reproducible when main_font_size is around 20+ (see issue details).\r\n\r\n### Root cause\r\nTimeline minimum sizing did not fully account for:\r\n\r\nactual width needed by the length text field in current theme font, and\r\nfull vertical size requirements of timeline handle and right-side controls.\r\n\r\n### Solution\r\nUpdated [animation_track_editor.cpp](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/guanxin/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/b6a47e94e3/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html) to:\r\n\r\napply a font-aware minimum width for the length field on theme changes, and\r\ninclude label/timeline-handle/right-controls heights in timeline minimum size calculation.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nBuilt editor locally on Windows with incremental SCons build.\r\nOpened AnimationPlayer timeline and verified no clipping with larger font sizes/scales (including main_font_size around 20+).\r\nConfirmed no obvious regressions at normal scale/font settings.\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\nMinimal, targeted UI sizing fix.\r\nNo API changes.\r\n\r\nFixes #115838 \r\n\r\n<img width=\"2568\" height=\"1400\" alt=\"50f21604455c1eafe48125452c23f329\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ddc6f42-5190-4cea-8be4-19d86b2825db\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-15T06:21:07Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T14:34:37Z","closed_at":"2026-02-20T14:33:00Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1ee8ff076e7f1e69c5e05db9e3e7368fc3e4c312","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"zhuguanxin:master","ref":"master","repo":null,"sha":"11e981e75363003008368147655d5f82631e692e","user":{"login":"zhuguanxin","id":64935188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTM1MTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64935188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin","html_url":"https://github.com/zhuguanxin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTYzNDk4MQ==","name":"godot","full_name":"godotengine/godot","owner":{"logi